why Every Horde quest of Stratholme, with the second run Betina's and the Duke's chains need.

# Stratholme's Horde quests in one guide: Nathanos Blightcaller, Tirion Fordring's chain through
# the Plaguelands to Artist Renfray, Light's Hope Chapel, Egan by the city, a
# first run, the hand-ins at Light's Hope, a second run, then the last
# hand-ins. Steps already done are passed over, so the guide picks up
# wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Tirion Fordring's 5542 Demon Dogs, 5543 Blood Tinged Skies and 5544
#   Carrion Grubbage -> 5742 Redemption -> 5781 Of
#   Forgotten Memories -> 5845 Of Lost Honor -> 5846 Of Love and Family (to
#   Artist Renfray) -> 5848 Of Love and Family (the painting) -> 5861 Find
#   Myranda.
# - Betina Bigglezink's 5212 The Flesh Does Not Lie -> 5213 The Active Agent
#   (the second run).
# - Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff's 5251 The Archivist -> the Head of Balnazzar's
#   5262 The Truth Comes Crashing Down -> 5263 Above and Beyond (the second
#   run) -> 5264 Lord Maxwell Tyrosus.
# - Smokey LaRue's 5214 The Great Ezra Grimm; Leonid Barthalomew's 5243
#   Houses of the Holy; Caretaker Alen's 5281 -> Egan's 5282 The Restless
#   Souls.
# - For characters who handed in 5462 (in the Scholomance guide), Leonid's
#   5463 -> 5464 Menethil's Gift.
# - Nathanos Blightcaller's 6022 To Kill With Purpose, 6042 Un-Life's Little
#   Annoyances and 6133 The Ranger Lord's Behest -> 6135 Duskwing, Oh How I
#   Hate Thee... and 6136 The Corpulent One -> 6163 Ramstein.
#
# Left out: 7480 Libram of Protection (as in the Dire Maul guide); 5122 The Medallion of Faith (repeatable in the data) and 5125
# Aurius' Reckoning after it; the repeatable 5063, 5067, 5068 and 8829; 5305,
# 8869 and 5307 (Blacksmithing quests); 7642 Collection of Goods (the
# paladin epic mount chain); 5166 (it needs the Upper Blackrock Spire's
# Gyth); 5265 and on after Lord Maxwell Tyrosus, 5862 and on after Find
# Myranda; the Dungeon Set 2 and Valthalak quests.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses or the objects inside, so
# their goals stand at the main gate (@26.5,10.4, Eastern Plaguelands) with
# `group 5`. The client's group finder lists two sides, each for five players
# of level 58 to 60: the Main Gate (the Scarlet half: Hearthsinger Forresten,
# Timmy the Cruel, Malor the Zealous, Cannon Master Willey, Archivist
# Galford, Balnazzar) and the Service Gate (the Scourge half: The Unforgiven,
# Baroness Anastari, Nerub'enkan, Maleki the Pallid, Magistrate Barthilas,
# Ramstein the Gorger, Baron Rivendare), in the client's dungeon journal's
# order. Every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that takes
# them in another order still gets each step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The quest texts place the painting in the
#   Scarlet Bastion and the Scourge Data in the ziggurats.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json): the main gate, in the live client's map of
#   the Eastern Plaguelands, so the guide's coordinates are live ones (`coords
#   live`). The data places no Service Gate.
# INGAME: where is the Service Gate, and where inside do the archives,
#   Menethil's Gift and the Scourge Data stand?

